@ProductCatalogApi_HostAddress = https://localhost:7258

### GET ALL
GET {{ProductCatalogApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

###
### CREATE PRODUCT
POST {{ProductCatalogApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "iPhone 17 Pro",
  "description": "Apple smartphone 256GB",
  "price": 4999
}
### GET BY ID
GET {{ProductCatalogApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

###

### UPDATE PRODUCT
PUT {{ProductCatalogApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop Pro",
  "description": "Updated Dell business laptop",
  "price": 4200
}

###

### VALIDATION TEST - MUST RETURN 400
POST {{ProductCatalogApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "description": "Invalid product",
  "price": -100
}

###

### DELETE PRODUCT
DELETE {{ProductCatalogApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/1